## Why a message has not gone out (one line under its subject)

outbox-not-sent = Haijatumwa kwa sababu { $reason }.
outbox-retrying = Bado haijatumwa kwa sababu { $reason }. Katna itajaribu tena yenyewe.
outbox-waiting-sign-in = Inasubiri uingie tena kwenye { $address }. Itatumwa wakati huo.
outbox-waiting-password = Inasubiri nenosiri jipya la { $address }. Itatumwa wakati huo.
outbox-waiting-connection = Inasubiri muunganisho. Itatumwa utakaporudi mtandaoni.

## Reasons, read from the mail server's answer (they follow "because")

outbox-reason-no-recipients = haina wapokeaji
outbox-reason-address = anwani inayotumwa kwake haipo
outbox-reason-too-large = ni kubwa mno kwa seva ya barua
outbox-reason-blocked = seva ya barua iliizuia
outbox-reason-gone = nakala yake kwenye kompyuta hii haipo tena
outbox-reason-refused = seva ya barua iliikataa

## Buttons and notes

outbox-try-again = Jaribu tena
outbox-edit = Hariri
outbox-delete = Futa
outbox-deleted = Imefutwa kwenye Kikasha toezi
outbox-sending-again = Inatuma tena…

outbox-snackbar-not-sent = “{ $subject }” haikutumwa kwa sababu { $reason }.
outbox-open = Kikasha toezi
